// Fns that give several values, through the build driver: given as
// '(a, b)', by a call, or by the branches of an 'if', and taken apart with
// 'let (a, b) = ...'.
// RUN: %ent run %S/Inputs/tuples.ent | FileCheck %s
// RUN: %ent run --parallel %S/Inputs/tuples.ent | FileCheck %s

// CHECK:      3 2 false 102 1 1.5 2
// CHECK-NEXT: red 1.5 at 1,5 to 13,23
// CHECK-NEXT: other 2.0 at 1,6 to 13,22
// CHECK-NEXT: other 2.0 at 1,5 to 13,23
// CHECK-NEXT: 3 2 false 102 1 1.5 2
// CHECK-NEXT: red 1.5 at 2,5 to 26,0
// CHECK-NEXT: other 2.0 at 1,7 to 1,0
// CHECK-NEXT: other 2.0 at 0,5 to 26,30
// CHECK-NOT:  {{.}}
